# Stilwell Farms: water autotiles + wild land (COMMON set). Top-left light, colour 3 = outline.
# Water = STONE pal: 0 sparkle, 1 shallows/lip, 2 slate water, 3 deep/outline (STONE is night-tinted; UI is not).
# Shore profile from a grass side: 1px light lip, 1px outline, then N = dark bank face + dither shadow,
# W = dither shadow, S/E = light foam line. Two adjacent shore sides round the corner (r=6).
# Ripples stay inside each 8x8 quad and all four WATER_15 quads are unique + unflipped, so the
# WATER_ANIM swap is safe and every variant tiles with every other one.
# Rope/sign line: stake centred at x6..8, rope meets cell edges at rows 7-8 (H) / column 7-8 (V).
# Objects on grass keep exact GRASS quadrants (pure-grass quads dedupe with 10_terrain).

# water autotiles: mask bit0=N bit1=E bit2=S bit3=W neighbour is water
